<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>We praise Thee, O God,</l><l>For Thy Spirit of light,</l><l>Who has shown us our Savior,</l><l>And scattered our night.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>All glory and praise</l><l>To Thee, Father of love,</l><l>For through Jesus’ redemption</l><l>Thy heart we may prove.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>We praise Thee again;</l><l>We are filled with Thy love,</l><l>And each heart is rekindled</l><l>With fire from above.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
